  "releaseNotes": [
    "Deprecated API definitions remain generated. Their PowerShell commands and deprecated request-model constructors emit warnings when used; WarningAction Stop prevents the request.",
    "Weekly updates record added, deprecated, and removed APIs and operations instead of treating lifecycle changes as publication failures. Generation, test, signing, and package verification checks remain required.",
    "The upstream schema removes six legacy Apps evaluation routes which were already excluded from previous commands. Analytics Apps replacement commands remain available. It also removes 51 unused legacy QlikCloud.Apps CLR model types, including Evaluation and Comparison; no active request, response, or exported model constructor references those types.",
    "Windows PowerShell 5.1 and PowerShell 7 remain supported with bundled dependencies and .NET Standard 2.0 project targets."
  ],
